TI  - Diversity and Function Patterns of Soil Microbial Communities in Native and Invasive Plants Along an Altitudinal Gradient in the Qinling Mountains
AU  - Jinlin Lyu
AU  - Ming Yue
AU  - Wenyan Xue
AU  - Yuchao Wang
